# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — Joomla's site template ships no login/logout module, and plg_system_keycloak exposes sign-out only as the route index.php?option=keycloak&task=logout (files/joomla-oidc-plugin/README.md, .../src/Extension/Keycloak.php handleLogout) — never as a rendered control. The persona's mandatory in-app logout step therefore has nothing to click, and navigating a logout URL directly is forbidden by the contract (see README "Persona contract opt-outs").
PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true

